  "description": {
    "en": "HEAD HAWK is a Tour-level co-polyester monofilament designed for advanced players who want an aggressive combination of explosive power and precise control. Crystal Core Technology balances a crystalline inner core responsible for control with outer molecular chains that enhance power. The round profile provides predictable response, durability and strong spin potential while remaining relatively hybrid-friendly. The 1.20 mm version emphasizes response and power, the 1.25 mm version offers the best overall balance, and the 1.30 mm version maximizes durability and stability.",

    "zh": "HEAD HAWK 是一款面向高水平巡回赛及竞技球员的共聚酯单丝球线，核心定位是在爆发力量与精准控制之间取得平衡。Crystal Core Technology 通过结晶内核强化控制，同时利用外层分子链增强力量输出。圆形截面提供稳定、可预测的击球反馈，并兼顾耐久性与旋转潜力，在混穿时也比棱形聚酯更加友好。1.20毫米版本更强调爆发力与响应；1.25毫米综合表现最均衡；1.30毫米则更偏向耐久与稳定。"
  },

